---
<section class="section" id="guardrails">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">08 · Trust &amp; Safety</span>
      <h2>Science guardrails — input <em>and</em> output.</h2>
      <p>
        AKD guardrails are not only input filters. They also inspect generated
        outputs before they are trusted or passed downstream — combining
        general-purpose AI safety, science-specific risk taxonomies, and
        defense-in-depth review patterns.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="guard-grid">
      <div class="guard-shell">
        <h3 style="margin-bottom:6px;">What guardrails detect</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom:18px;">A non-exhaustive view of the failure modes guardrails actively check for in scientific agent outputs:</p>
        <ul class="guard-list">
          <li>Hallucination</li>
          <li>Attribution gaps</li>
          <li>Unsupported claims</li>
          <li>Outdated confidence</li>
          <li>Overgeneralization</li>
          <li>Lack of grounding</li>
          <li>Multidisciplinary reasoning failures</li>
          <li>Consistency issues</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" style="margin-top:22px;" href="https://github.com/NASA-IMPACT/akd/tree/main/guardrails" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" width="14" height="14"><path d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8a8 8 0 0 0 5.47 7.59c.4.07.55-.17.55-.38v-1.33c-2.23.48-2.7-1.07-2.7-1.07-.36-.92-.89-1.17-.89-1.17-.73-.5.06-.49.06-.49.81.06 1.24.83 1.24.83.72 1.23 1.88.87 2.34.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.13 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82a7.7 7.7 0 0 1 4 0c1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.11.16 1.93.08 2.13.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48v2.2c0 .21.15.46.55.38A8 8 0 0 0 16 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8z"/></svg>
          View guardrails on GitHub
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="guard-cards">
        <div class="pill-card">
          <h4>Granite Guardian</h4>
          <p>Foundation-model-based safety checks integrated into the AKD guardrail layer.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pill-card">
          <h4>Risk Agent</h4>
          <p>Reasoning component that classifies and explains risks in agent outputs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pill-card">
          <h4>FactReasoner</h4>
          <p>Targeted factuality reasoning over claims, attribution, and supporting evidence.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pill-card">
          <h4>NASA Science-Specific Risk Taxonomy</h4>
          <p>Domain-aware risk categories tailored to scientific contexts and agent failure modes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pill-card">
          <h4>Defense-in-Depth</h4>
          <p>Layered checks across input, intermediate steps, and output — not a single gate.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .guard-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
    gap: 28px;
  }
  .guard-shell {
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 32px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--surface), var(--bg-1));
  }
  .guard-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0; margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .guard-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
  }
  .guard-list li::before {
    content: "";
    width: 6px; height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent-3);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--accent-3);
  }
  .guard-cards {
    display: grid; gap: 14px;
  }
  .guard-cards .pill-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 18px 20px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
  }
  .guard-cards .pill-card h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 17px;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
  }
  .guard-cards .pill-card p { font-size: 13.5px; margin: 0; }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .guard-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .guard-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
